{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky Madness is an upcoming arcade snowboarding game with a focus on speed and big air inspired by classics like SSX and 1080.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/extras/902322b64970bc998120744f74986b30.avif?t=1753825387\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Build up boost levels by scoring points while from tricks and grinding. Upon landing, unleash a powerful boost for a limited time based on the level you've built. Frequent tricking is the key to enhancing your speed for a thrilling ride!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/extras/e1478f85325e70aa04d401d36e612948.avif?t=1753825387\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Build up your Freaky meter with spins, flips, grabs, and grinds then perform Wicked Tricks and Wicked Grinds to really score big. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Superman, The Worm, and The Butt Slide Grind are some of the many Wicked Tricks you can unleash as you style on the slopes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/extras/d557b7c79fdf44c274eaef55fc55f1e9.avif?t=1753825387\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Chain tricks together to score more points based on the number of tricks you performed in a combo. Extra points earned form combos are held in a separate counter and are cashed in when you stop the combo or completely lost if you wipeout, manage this risk-reward element is key to mastering the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/extras/297969d136670472c1bd6d3569ecef14.avif?t=1753825387\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 handcrafted levels each with their own hidden surprises and unique experiences </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dedicated campaign mode set on an open-world mountain with secrets and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 fully voiced characters with their own backstory, personality and visual style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voiced in-game DJ commentator hyping you up your moves. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743850?t=1753825387","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753825387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/561a29a557206c87b50ebeb40b57bbf471cf71f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753825387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/561a29a557206c87b50ebeb40b57bbf471cf71f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753825387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky Madness is an upcoming arcade snowboarding game with a focus on speed and big air inspired by classics like SSX and 1080.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/extras/902322b64970bc998120744f74986b30.avif?t=1753825387\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Build up boost levels by scoring points while from tricks and grinding. Up