n backstory, personality and visual style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voiced in-game DJ commentator hyping you up your moves. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Nathan Dearth"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743850/bae2bc7f86b2a656fc062d216e71a65b024e9178/header.jpg?t=1753825387","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04, SteamOS 3.0, or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4260U 1.40GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04, SteamOS 3.0, or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570k 3.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4260U 1.40GHz (Intel Only)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570k 3.4GHz (Intel Only)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB availab